 <!doctype html>
-<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"><title>QIK-VRT TEMDD Live Universal Terminal</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#090c10;color:#e8edf2;font:14px/1.45 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}main{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:18px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:14px}.p{background:#11171e;border:1px solid #303a46;border-radius:12px;padding:16px}.meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:6px}.muted{color:#8d9aaa}.ok{color:#68d391}.hold{color:#ecc94b}#tail{height:68vh;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;background:#070a0d;padding:12px;border-radius:8px}.badge{border:1px solid #43505e;border-radius:99px;padding:2px 8px}button{background:#18212b;color:#e8edf2;border:1px solid #43505e;border-radius:7px;padding:6px 10px}.ide-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:12px}.ide-grid textarea,.ide-grid pre{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;min-height:320px;background:#070a0d;color:#e8edf2;border:1px solid #303a46;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;font:13px/1.4 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.ide-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:8px 0}.ide-status{white-space:pre-wrap}.ide-status.ok{color:#68d391}.ide-status.hold{color:#ecc94b}@media(max-width:800px){.grid,.ide-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}#tail{height:55vh}}</style></head><body><main><h1>QIK-VRT · TEMDD LIVE UNIVERSAL TERMINAL <span id="state" class="badge hold">CONNECTING</span></h1><p class="muted">Observer lifetime ≠ execution lifetime · exact-subject evidence · fail-closed · replayable event cursor</p><div class="grid"><section class="p"><h2>Exact checkout subject</h2><div class="meta"><span class="muted">Authority</span><span id="repository">—</span><span class="muted">PR</span><span id="pr">—</span><span class="muted">HEAD</span><span id="head">—</span><span class="muted">TREE</span><span id="tree">—</span><span clas