 ```text
 sequence(e1,e2) MUST NOT imply cause(e1,e2)
 cause(e1,e2) iff e1.event_id in e2.cause_event_ids
 ```
 
-A timestamp, ledger sequence number, PR number or file order MUST NOT manufacture
